'''{{PAGENAME}}''' is a set of [[heavy armor]] in ''[[Helldivers 2]]''.

==Acquisition==
Both the body armor and [[helmet]] can be bought from the [[Masters of Ceremony Premium Warbond|Masters of Ceremony]] page in the [[Superstore]] for {{Currency|SC|400|notext}} and 200 [[Super Credits]], respectively.

